Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: The series shows unstable ranking and strong trend; a per‑horizon weighted scheme may capture changing best models across horizons.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"best_per_horizon"}

Thought: The series has unstable ranking and strong trend; try a per‑horizon top‑k mean to capture horizon‑specific strengths.  
