Thought: ranking is unstable and trend dominates; try a weighted combination that accounts for error trend across windows (error_trend) to capture models improving over time.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"error_trend"}

Thought: The ranking is unstable and several models are correlated; a subset of the best‑performing models may give a cleaner weighted combo.  
Action: select_top_k  
Action Input: {"k":7,"metric":"rmse"}

Thought: Test a robust weighted combination on the reduced, low‑error pool (trend‑dominated, unstable ranking) using inverse error weights to see if focusing on the best few models improves over DBA.  
