Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool4","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: trend-dominated with unstable ranking suggests a robust weighted scheme; test softmax_neg_error on the full pool to see if it improves over DBA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

Thought: Test a robust DBA combination on the reduced pool4 to see if restricting to the strongest models improves the trend‑dominated series.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: The series shows unstable ranking and strong trend; per‑horizon top‑k weighting may capture horizon‑specific strengths that a global weighted combo misses.

Action: weights_topk_per_horizon

Action Input: {"pool":"pool4","k":5,"metric":"rmse"}

Thought: Test a robust weighted combination on the stable pool4 using softmax_neg_error weights to see if a smoother weighting improves over the current dba leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool4","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

